(T_T)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな、\nプリンシパル本当にお疲れ様。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"演出の江本さん、\n脚本の喜安さん、\nプリンシパルに携わって下さった\nスタッフのみなさん、\nそして観に来て下さった\nファンのみなさん、\n本当にありがとうございました(T_T)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この素晴らしい経験を胸に\nこれからも頑張ります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kazumi.takayama/img/blog/kazumi.takayama/img/2013/06/04/7280671/0000.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-18303":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も１日おつかれさまですっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/05/05/1600024/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ろってぃーだよ..*  キランっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/05/05/1600024/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/05/05/1600024/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私が持ってるこのCDは ルヒカちゃんのCDです ! !"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"TSUBAKIのCMでおなじみの『 独り言花 』という曲を歌っている方ですね ^^\nそしてルヒカちゃんが新曲『君と踊ろう 』を発売したということで頂きました〜.♪\nプリンシパルが終わって少し落ち着いたら、ご飯にでも誘ってみようと思ってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/05/05/1600024/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こうゆうCDだよ〜\\(*´∀｀)/\nいい声しているのでよかったら聴いてみてくださいね..*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/05/05/1600024/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"}